[32m# Seed‑Investor Stratification Tool for Alzheimer’s‑Disease Risk – Maryland, 2026  
[0m
[32m**A Research Report for IGC Pharma**  

[0m
[32m*Prepared 10 Oct 2026*  

[0m
[32m---  

[0m
[32m## Table of Contents  

[0m
[32m| # | Section |
[0m
[32m|---|---|
[0m
[32m| 1 | Executive Summary |
[0m
[32m| 2 | Company Overview |
[0m
[32m| 3 | Market Landscape – Alzheimer’s‑Disease (AD) Risk Stratification |
[0m
[32m| 4 | Funding Environment – National & Maryland‑Specific Trends |
[0m
